From: NNois <noel.froger@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 12 Jan 2026 09:46:28 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] bc6dec and bc6enc generated start version

---
 libavcodec/bc6dec.c | 718 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 libavcodec/bc6dec.h |  16 +
